{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":231306,\"title\":\"Exclusive Fairytale\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Ling Chao and Xiao Tu have been childhood rivals and inseparable friends since kindergarten. Despite his brilliance and perfectionism, Ling Chao always lived in the shadow of Xiao Tu in his mother’s eyes. As they grow up together, their playful rivalry turns into something more.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t2rRWqKgnVrMtmst0VOEQv0hA1J.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ztNIh5lBUjVLjQLa0GrKUgytGiX.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":25,\"year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":24,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"iQiyi\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-07-27\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4179508,\"name\":\"Gong Yushi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1625880,\"name\":\"JUN\",\"character\":\"Ling Chao\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z1seXrQQWG7nsQVHqSWKefJQ8DO.jpg\"},{\"id\":3372607,\"name\":\"Zhang Miaoyi\",\"character\":\"Xiao Tu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjXOIPJG7dIsFrBiPXMBcJPbMWN.jpg\"},{\"id\":3970281,\"name\":\"Xiong Aobo\",\"character\":\"Yin Zihan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vRD20eFfveBihRtdFz5AJdaFObs.jpg\"},{\"id\":3929205,\"name\":\"Lv Zhao\",\"character\":\"Jiang Juanjuan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efkvIzLcYbgnheY036IJvwQJN3e.jpg\"},{\"id\":4179527,\"name\":\"Hao Zhuyu\",\"character\":\"Jia Siwen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aWwAMlPDFIA4lfAiulk4vluZurO.jpg\"},{\"id\":3456432,\"name\":\"Tan Jiatai\",\"character\":\"Zhu Wenyu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7U850Aj2H0JhLCw9CdJhiPFeP8N.jpg\"},{\"id\":3239390,\"name\":\"Cheryn Lin\",\"character\":\"Xu Linlong\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a6iaVNa